+ entry .Signature   una firma hecha por una `PrivateKey`, tipada por su cifrado

= entry .Signature   a signature made by a `PrivateKey`, typed by its cipher
-   detail
+   detail

-       `Signature[cipher]` wraps the raw signature bytes, so a signature can only be verified
-       against a `PublicKey` of the same cipher. It is covariant in the cipher. Made by
-       `PrivateKey#sign`, checked by `PublicKey#verify`; `Showable` as base64, `Inspectable` as
-       hexadecimal, and `Encodable in Data` as its bytes.
+       `Signature[cipher]` envuelve los bytes en bruto de la firma, de modo que una firma solo
+       puede verificarse con una `PublicKey` del mismo cifrado. Es covariante en el cifrado. La
+       crea `PrivateKey#sign` y la comprueba `PublicKey#verify`; es `Showable` como base64,
+       `Inspectable` como hexadecimal y `Encodable in Data` como sus bytes.

=       hexadecimal, and `Encodable in Data` as its bytes.
