-       The `Crypto` provider is chosen by one import, which selects hashing too. Two of the
-       givens are gastronomy's: `providers.javaBaseProvider` (the JDK, from which
-       `Crypto.javaBaseCrypto` derives `JavaBaseCrypto`) and `providers.soundnessProvider`
-       (pure Scala, from which `Crypto.soundnessCrypto` derives `SoundnessCrypto`). This
-       package adds the OpenSSL one, from `enigmatic.openssl`.
+       El proveedor `Crypto` se elige con una sola importación, que selecciona también el hash.
+       Dos de los givens son de gastronomy: `providers.javaBaseProvider` (el JDK, del que
+       `Crypto.javaBaseCrypto` deriva `JavaBaseCrypto`) y `providers.soundnessProvider` (Scala
+       puro, del que `Crypto.soundnessCrypto` deriva `SoundnessCrypto`). Este paquete añade el
+       de OpenSSL, de `enigmatic.openssl`.

